 must provide the music source)\n\nThis project was started when we were not able to own a real physical drum set anymore. It has been tuned the past 2 years and has brought us the feeling we were striving for. I hope it can bring others the same joy. We believe we have become better drummers from what we were, practicing in this game.", "short_description": "A VR drum kit instrument simulator. Practice in the privacy of VR, play and mod your own realistic looking drum set."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aliencybercoat.wixsite.com/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Alien Cyber Coat", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://aliencybercoat.wixsite.com/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24574225638890439"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 6, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4558610524380313"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "862198186815944"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1237100848309643"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1165910468862039"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1212113480832966"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "875339057622688"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "4558610524380313"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1774282260, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "45586105